[Setting Up Password Policy to Enforce Strong Passwords]


Open up 'Group Policy Management' in Windows Administrative Tools in START
>> Group Policy Management

To create a new GPO:

right click on forrest (e.g aden.local)
>> 'Create a GPO in this domain, and Link it here...'
Name it as you please, the more standard the better. 

right click your GPO folder
>> Edit

Computer Config. >> Policies >> Windows Settings >> Security Settings >>
Account Policies >> Password Policy

= various custom policies for password enforcement







